# SPA fallback for client-side routes (/find, /leads, /lists, …).
# Public marketing routes (/, /blog, /blog/<slug>, /contact, /privacy,
# /terms) are prerendered static files and served directly; everything
# else falls back to the noindex app shell. API routes must pass through
# untouched — never serve a shell for /api/*.
/api/*    /api/:splat    200
/*        /app.html      200
